---
error[E0820]: the packed struct `PA` holds the aligned struct `A16` in its field `b`
  --> mem:///main.lu:15:5
   |
15 |     b: A16,
   |     ^ no single C layout for this field
   |
   = note: C compilers disagree on an aligned struct inside a packed one: gcc and clang on SysV and
     Apple targets place it at the next byte, the MSVC ABI keeps its alignment
     ([abi.layout.packed]). Pack the outer struct without the aligned one inside it, or drop
     `packed`.

